                "sound": "text/sound/62268/860371",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.jpg"
            },
            {
                "text": "nyux saku ini aras pila . ksyugi saku cikah pila su hku?",
                "textCh": "我沒有帶錢。你可以借我錢嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/62268/860372",
                "image": "boy.png",
                "background": "1-2.jpg"
            },
            {
